":\\\"summary_text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"**Summarizing JSON-RPC calls and temporary file artifacts**\\\"}]}\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"# Final verdict: FAIL\\n\\n## Design findings\\n\\n- **Pages/order:** PASS — `01, 02, 03, 04, 05, 06, 90`.\\n- **Frame sizes:** PASS — `n1404`, `n1320`, `n1505`, `n1322` are each `1440×980`.\\n- **Rendered layout:** PASS — inspected exported PNGs; no visible obscured text, title/content overlap, clipping, or overflow.\\n- **Page 04 (`n1404`):** PASS — hybrid administrator home; clearly prioritizes Recursos y catálogos.\\n- **Page 05 (`n1320`):** PASS — clearly maps foundational databases, ordering, and dependencies.\\n- **Page 06 (`n1505`):** PASS — usable low-fi resources/catalogs hub.\\n- **Page 90 (`n1322`):** PASS for future-stage status; visibly states it does not belong to the current stage.\\n- **Spanish-only content:** **FAIL**\\n  - `n1503`: visible English loanword **“backlog”**.\\n  - `n1381`: visible English term **“swimlanes”**.\\n\\n## Lint results\\n\\nNo lint **errors** on any target.\\n\\n- `n1404`: 63 findings:\\n  - 51 `warning/text-explicit-height`, IDs `n1405–n1455` inclusive.\\n  - 12 contrast-only `info/text-bg-contrast`, IDs `n1405–n1416`.\\n  - Render inspection showed no actual visible clipping.\\n- `n1320`: 0 findings.\\n- `n1505`: 7 contrast-only `info/text-bg-contrast`, IDs `n1506–n1512`; no visible contrast failure in the rendered sidebar.\\n- `n1322`: 1 `warning/text-explicit-height`, ID `n1503`; rendered text appeared fully visible.\\n\\n## Export evidence\\n\\n- `/tmp/openpencil-verification-n1404.png` — 101,124 bytes\\n- `/tmp/openpencil-verification-n1320.png` — 111,585 bytes\\n- `/tmp/openpencil-verification-n1505.png` — 87,975 bytes\\n- `/tmp/openpencil-verification-n1322.png` — 103,629 bytes\\n\\n## Commands/calls executed\\n\\nDirect MCP JSON-RPC methods and exact arguments:\\n\\n- `initialize(protocolVersion=\\\"2025-03-26\\\", clientInfo={name:\\\"verification-agent\\\",version:\\\"1.0\\\"})`\\n- `tools/list {}`\\n- `list_pages {}`\\n- `export_nodes {nodeIds:[\\\"n1404\\\",\\\"n1320\\\",\\\"n1505\\\",\\\"n1322\\\"],format:\\\"png\\\",scale:1}` — failed: malformed tool call.\\n- `export_item {itemId:<each target frame>,format:\\\"png\\\",scale:1}` — succeeded.\\n- `get_node {node_id:<each target frame>}`\\n- `lint_document {nodeId:<each target frame>}`\\n- `snapshot_layout {parentId:\\\"n1322\\\",maxDepth:2,pageId:\\\"n1321\\\"}`\\n\\n## Blocker / unexpected mutation\\n\\nThe required PNG exports were expected outputs. However, direct-MCP diagnostics also created unexpected temporary files:\\n\\n- `/tmp/openpencil-mcp-headers.txt`\\n- `/tmp/pi-bash-1f66059df3f416ac.log`\\n- `/tmp/pi-bash-22ea928f1d5f4250.log`\\n\\nThey were not cleaned up. Repository mutation status remains unverified because no status command was authorized.\",\"textSignature\":\"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_0dbc245bf8bc27a1016a93dff4c2a487d09df6c9692c596d80\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"final_answer\\\"}\"}],\"api\":\"openai-codex-responses\",\"provider\":\"openai-codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.6-sol\",\"usage\":{\"input\":1161,\"output\":2825,\"cacheRead\":70272,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"reasoning\":2070,\"totalTokens\":74258,\"cost\":{\"input\":0.005805,\"output\":0.08475,\"cacheRead\":0.035136,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"total\":0.125691}},\"stopReason\":\"stop\",\"timestamp\":1788075980564,\"responseId\":\"resp_0dbc245bf8bc27a1016a93dfcd13e887d08c3d88445f872462\",\"rawStopReason\":\"completed\"}}\n    \n    [Showing lines 3-8 of 8 (50.0KB limit). Full output: /tmp/pi-bash-ee1de35bdc8429a8.log]"}],"details":{"truncation":{"content":"60:{\"type\":\"message\",\"id\":\"0122aca9\",\"parentId\":\"26a934c4\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-30T07:45:37.989Z\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"**Planning lint output parsing and summarization**\",\"thinkingSignature\":\"{\\\"id\\\":\\\"rs_0dbc245bf8bc27a1016a93df9ba43c87d0bd8431ca119af5c5\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"reasoning