 **84 mutating payloads**, including initial HTML imports, node updates, page creation/deletion/reordering, design.md, and final renames.\\n- Including related subagent logs:\\n  - 19 files\\n  - 283 OpenPencil-related calls\\n  - 34,080,705 bytes retained.\\n\\nThis forms a practical transaction log suitable for replay into an isolated OpenPencil instance.\\n\\n## Native snapshot/autosave findings\\n\\n- `design.op` is **not** the live document:\\n  - Size: `16,201` bytes\\n  - mtime: `2026-08-30 10:15:05.749513428 -0700`\\n  - SHA-256: `520c74c91a335a8d8d8a0953c1293c9ce47ce903f20a60b8130a3dc834a99a44`\\n  - One root page only: `n1504`, `06 Maestro de Recursos`\\n  - 94 unique nodes\\n  - None of active roots `n380`, `n465`, `n564`, `n2032`, `n2284`, `n2337`, `n2081`, `n2136`, `n2191`, `n2390`, `n2477` are present.\\n  - It is tracked in Git and matches blob `5fac084e17a5dbc282b0525830008af5cf0ba967`.\\n\\n- No additional `.op`/`.pen`, autosave, recovery, or OpenPencil backup was found under:\\n  - `$HOME`\\n  - `/tmp`, `/var/tmp`\\n  - `~/.config`, `~/.cache`, `~/.local/share`, `~/.local/state`\\n  - `~/.openpencil` exists but is empty.\\n  - Chromium Local Storage, Session Storage, IndexedDB, Service Worker and Sessions showed no GARFEX/live-root hits.\\n  - VS Code/Cursor history and backup locations showed no matching snapshot.\\n  - The retained oversized MCP result `/tmp/pi-mcp-output-0I3ptO/mcp-result-2ab826e0.txt` no longer exists.\\n\\n- Historical save attempts show:\\n  - Workspace save failed with `ENOENT`.\\n  - Relative save failed with permission denied.\\n  - `/tmp/garfex-design.op` succeeded at `2026-08-30T05:12:34.552Z`, but this was only the early **3-page** server-side state.\\n  - That path is absent from host `/tmp`.\\n\\n## Container/process evidence\\n\\n- No original desktop OpenPencil process remains.\\n- Current service is a newly created container:\\n  - ID `518d7b9fc960...`\\n  - Created `2026-08-31T04:44:42.557990805Z`\\n  - Started `2026-08-31T04:44:43.917065641Z`\\n  - Process: `/app/op-host-web-server --serve-web 3100 --host 0.0.0.0`\\n  - HTTP `/` returns `200 OK`.\\n  - It has no open `.op` or workspace document file.\\n- Shell history records:\\n  - Old container started at `2026-08-30T21:41:16-07:00`\\n  - Stopped and removed at `2026-08-30T21:44:17-07:00`\\n  - Current replacement was created seconds later.\\n- `/var/lib/docker/overlay2` is root-only, so deleted-layer forensics was not inspectable. Even if recoverable, it would most likely contain only the early 3-page `/tmp` save, not the final in-memory state.\\n\\n## PNG comparison\\n\\n- `page04.png`: `2026-08-30 10:09:16`, older workstation/bandeja view.\\n- Working-page exports:\\n  - `n2033.png`: `11:32:02`\\n  - `n2082.png`: `11:32:11`\\n  - `n2192.png`: `11:32:14`\\n  - `n2137.png`: `11:32:17`\\n- All are valid `1440×980` PNGs and visually preserve four principal screens.\\n- They predate the final recorded state at `12:40:36`, and do not preserve editable structure or the remaining pages.\\n\\n## Blockers / unverified\\n\\n- OpenPencil MCP proxy calls returned `MCP not initialized`; current server page state could not be queried through the authorized MCP surface.\\n- Deleted Docker-layer inspection requires privileged filesystem forensics.\\n- Exact byte-identical reconstruction is not proven; replay may need node-ID reconciliation.\\n- One broad content scan timed out, but targeted document, application-storage, browser, editor-history, runtime, temporary and transaction-log searches completed.\\n- No test/build/lint commands were run.\\n- Repository was clean before and after inspection; no files were modified.\\n\\n## Safest next action\\n\\n1. **Do not overwrite `design.op` and do not remove/prune Docker data.**\\n2. Preserve forensic copies of the 23 MB parent JSONL, related subagent JSONLs, current `design.op`, and PNG exports.\\n3. In a separate mounted directory/new OpenPencil instance, extract and replay the MCP mutations chronologically through line `1566`.\\n4. Save to a new filename such as `design-recovered.op`.\\n5. Verify the exact 18-page list, archived ordering, design.md, key node IDs and visual exports before replacing anything.\\n\\n### Principal read-only commands used\\n\\n```bash\\ngit rev-parse --show-toplevel || pwd\\ngit status --short\\nfind \\\"$HOME\\\" -xdev -type f \\\\( -iname '*.op' -o -iname '*.op.*' -o -iname '*.pen' ... \\\\)\\nfind /tmp /var/tmp -xdev -type f \\\\( -iname '*.op' ... \\\\)\\njq -r '\\\"name=\\\\(.name) version=\\\\(.version) rootChildren=\\\\(.children|length)\\\", ...' design.op\\nps -eo pid,ppid,lstart,cmd --sort=pid\\ndocker ps -a --no-trunc --filter 'name=openpencil'\\ndocker inspect openpencil-web ...\\ndocker diff openpencil-web\\nss -ltnp\\njournalctl --user --since '2026-08-30 00:00:00'\\ngit log --all --stat -- design.op\\nsha256sum design.op\\ncurl -sS -D - -o /dev/null --max-time 5 http://127.0.0.1:3100/\\n```\\n\\nPython JSONL parsers were run from stdin against the cited transcript files; they produced summaries only and wrote no files.\",\"textSignature\":\"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_0afb135b16b98b4f016a950a57c20087d0bdd80836baf1a3d9\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"final_answer\\\"}\"}],\"api\":\"openai-codex-responses\",\"provider\":\"openai-codex\",\"model\":\"gpt-5.6-sol\",\"usage\":{\"input\":3104,\"output\":3057,\"cacheRead\":125568,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"reasoning\":1337,\"totalTokens\":131729,\"cost\":{\"input\":0.01552,\"output\":0.09171,\"cacheRead\":0.06278399999999999,\"cacheWrite\":0,\"total\":0.170014}},\"stopReason\":\"stop\",\"timestamp\":1788152379929,\"responseId\":\"resp_0afb135b16b98b4f016a950a3c2b5087d0831f9551c6226736\",\"rawStopReason\":\"completed\"}}\n    "}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1788152822159}}
